window.products.push({"id":692088,"name":"netoolen Weighted Blanket 15lbs for Adults, 60x80in Dual Sided Sherpa Fleece Striped Flannel Heavy Thick Soft Cozy Fuzzy Bed Blanket for Bedroom Sofa ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EH4M-xXoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dual Side Weighted Blanket: A combination of 250GSM flannel with ribbed lines that feel extra calming and cozy and 220GSM white Sherpa that’s breathable and warm like lambwool, these blankets offer over-the-cloud fluffiness and softness, helping you fall fast asleep in its cuddles Snug Snuggles: netoolen weighted blankets feature sturdy 7 layer and 8” x 12” grid design to tightly secure the glass beads, avoiding leakage, rustles, and clusters with balanced weight distribution that contours to the shape of your body. Being cocooned in its snuggles hep you feel secure and relaxed, then sleep profoundly How to Choose a Weighted Blanket: We recommend you choose a weighted blanket that’s 10% of your body weight plus 1lbs, e.g., this 15lbs blankets are suitable for people weighing 140 - 180lbs. Please start with a lighter one and allow 3 to 5 days for your body to get adapted. They can be versatile for lounging to relieve sour shoulders and knees. Use Anywhere & Excellent Gift: Available in 2 sizes and 6 colors to fit in any decor on bed, couch, or in the car, these blankets are finely made to be resistant to fading, shedding, and pilling. Give this exquisite gift to your family and friends on anniversaries, birthdays, and holidays, also treat your pets to this plushest blanket and see how they turn dozy and sweet in the blink of an eye Care and Support: To better preserve the blankets, wash them in a commercial washer and tumble dry on low heat. We value your experience and feedback, if you encounter any issues, please contact us at any time and we will respond within 24 hours and try our best to resolve to your fullest satisfaction","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EH4M-xXoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"netoolen","source_asin":"B097TCL254","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-692088","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097TCL254","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097TCL254","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
