window.products.push({"id":692153,"name":"Montessori Toys for Babies 6-12 Months Baby Silicon Sensory Travel Pull String Teething Toys for 3-6 Months 1 Year Old Hang on Stroller Crib Car Seat ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wUoPE5aJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Colorful UFO Design Montessori Toys 】UFO-shaped sensory teething toys for babies 6-12 months is also an excellent early Montessori toys for 1 year old, suitable for all boys and girls aged 3-24 months, with a hole to hang by baby side wherever baby is. This Montessori toy can accompany your baby, help distinguish colors, shapes; develop various senses sensibility, practice fine motor skills while pulling the texture ropes, squeezing bubbles, moving slides. 【Pull String Toddler Sensory Toy】This montessori toys for babies 0-6 months have 6 ropes with different textures and shapes, the rope can be pulled from one side to the other, which can exercise the baby's hand fine motor skill. Different textures can bring rich tactile experience, different difficulties and vibration sounds when pulling the rope through. Good toys for babies 6-12 months for cultivating the perception and finger movement ability. 【Multi-Play and Multi-Sensory Baby Travel Toys】The Montessori toys for 3M+ has other fun ways to play.1st: The pop fidget for relieve stress.2nd: Press the button down and slide left and right to flexibility baby's finger. 3rd: Teething Toy function-This baby sensory toys has different textures of dots and lines on both sides of the 6 silicon ropes, when the baby bite or touches it, it will bring different tactile feelings. Great baby sensory toys 6-12 months. 【Silicone Baby Teething Toys 】 The rope is made of high-quality 100% food-grade silicone, BPA free, smooth, odor-free, durable, it is harmless for babies. This silicone teething toys are suitable for babies 0-6 months 6-12 months, Toddlers 1-2 years old, it can relieve the discomfort of baby's teething gums and help babies develop chewing skills. 【Perfect Baby Toy Gifts 】This pull string toys for baby is lightweight and portable, can be played in crib, stroller, suitable as toddler travel toys for 1 year old, but also perfect for thanksgiving, Christmas New Year, Birthday, Easter, Children's Day and any other gifting occasion for your baby, nephew, grandkids. It is a good helper for babies with autism to reduce stress and anxiety.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wUoPE5aJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COUOMOXA","source_asin":"B0BQYSSKPG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-692153","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQYSSKPG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQYSSKPG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
