window.products.push({"id":692164,"name":"Dolicer 8PCS Artificial Gold Glitter Leaf Fake Plants Golden Leaves Christmas Glitter Leaf Spray Christmas Floral Arrangement for Christmas Winter Wed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71T7tG2uReL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Christmas is approaching, and there are many things to decorate. Using only green leaves seems a bit monotonous, so how about adding some gold and silver leaves? Our products have gold flashes, soft and flexible materials, and can be changed shape at will. The colors are classic and outdated. Artificial glitter leaves are fashionable and versatile. They are a good companion for many objects. Product description Material : Plastic Size:23.6 inches Color: Gold Features : DIY decoration,bendable, colorful Artificial glitter leaves are mainly used for Christmas, not only can be decorated on Christmas trees and other green plants, but also can be used as decorations for gift boxes; the rest can also be used in other festivals, such as Halloween, Mother's Day or party decoration. Artificial glitter leaves are gold and silver, and it’s suitable for the red gift box and green plants, there are thin shimmers on it, the glitter will drop slightly during use, which is normal.It looks slightly shiny from a distance, which is very warm at Christmas. Artificial glitter leaves are made of soft plastic, which can be bent and changed at will. Whether they are decorated indoors or outdoors, or in boxes or vases, there will be no problems that they can’t fit in, and they are very useful.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71T7tG2uReL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dolicer","source_asin":"B09ZQMXT55","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-692164","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZQMXT55","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZQMXT55","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
