window.products.push({"id":692173,"name":"Merelax Ultrasonic Humidifiers for Bedroom Large Room Home, 6L Warm Cool Mist Humidifier for Baby Plants,Top Fill Essential Oil Diffuser Auto-Shut Off","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610PiBdn3RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Name: Ultrasonic Humidifier Model: HU2201W Product Size: 22*22*22cm Maximum Noise Level: <30dB Water Tank Capacity: 6L / 1.59gal Remote Control Distance: ≤10 meters Max Mist Capacity: 600mL/h Max Running Time Before Next Refill: 50H Power cord length: 1.300 meter/4.27feet Water Tank Filling Made Easy With larger water tank, humidifying your indoor air has never been easier. Thanks to its simple tank top fill design, all you have to do is to remove the 6L water tank from the base with the integrated handle. Turn the tank upside down, remove the cap and fill with cool water. Return the tank to the base and start humidifying your space. Its clear tank design makes it easy to see when it’s time to refill the water tank. Adjustable Mist Volum and Direction There are 3 mist volumn for this humidifier: low mist-the output is 160ml / h (use 50H), medium mist-the output is 350ml / h (use 25H), high mist-the output is 600ml / h (use 15H). The direction of the mist flow can be adjusted according to your needs. Auto Mist Humidistat Maintaining a consistently comfortable space has never been easier than with this ultrasonic humidifier. This auto model  uses an auto-adjusting humidistat that maintains your programmed humidity level automatically. During operation, the humidifier's humidity sensor continually senses the ambient humidity of your room and turns the humidifier on if the humidity falls below your selected level. This feature boosts the unit's energy efficiency while helping you maximize the comfort of your home. Plants & Nursery Humidifier This humidifer is ideal to keep the humidity up for plants at home or in the office. When the house gets a little dry, move it to kids room to give extra moisture for better environment. The noise level of the humidifier is below 30dB,  almost silent so that you and your loved ones can sleep peacefully. Once the water in the tank is used up, the humidifier will automatically turn off, making it safe to use in baby rooms and bedrooms. Essential Oil Diffuser Humidifier This aromatherapy air humidifier has an aromatherapy box. You can add your favorite essential oils to the aroma box and enjoy the relaxing natural scent in your home. Touch Button controls With upgraded technology, the humidifier easily displays your current settings and status, make adjustments to your mist output level and desired relative humidity with just the touch of a button. Simple yet Mordern Design This Ultrasonic humidifier is a great unit to keep your space comfortably humidified during dry wintry months. The cool and warm mist humidifier incorporates precise digital controls along with an ultra-modern crisp white/classic black design that looks great on any table or nightstand. This humidifier runs for up to 50 hours continuously and works best in medium-sized spaces up to 500 square feet.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610PiBdn3RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Merelax","source_asin":"B0BFKJXL1C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-692173","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFKJXL1C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFKJXL1C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
