window.products.push({"id":692189,"name":"Acacia Pizza Cutting Board and Pizza Cutter Set Round Wooden Chopping Board Pizza Peel With 8 Grooves To Slice and Portion Your Pizza Great for Servin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IDKqq7z+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Are you still troubled by the uneven pizza cutting? This pizza board can help you solve this problem. Deep groove on the board can guide your pizza cutter and help you get 8 identical pieces. The board is made of acacia wood. Compared with other woods, acacia wood has a darker color and a more beautiful wood grain.And the acacia wood has a delicate wood, uniform structure, good stability, strong toughness, corrosion resistance, and low shrinkage. Kitchenware made of acacia wood is more beautiful and more durable Versatile, double sided board. For perfect pizza slices use the large, 10inch cutting surface with pre-cut grooves to guide your pizza cutter. Or, flip the board over for a smooth, flat, 9 inch surface, perfect for a cheese board. The pizza cutter is made of acacia wood and stainless steel. Wooden handle is more comfortable than metal handle, and it is more difficult to slip off from your hand. The stainless steel blade will not rust and be damaged even after a long period of use. The product is packed in white paper box and transparent plastic cover, which is beautifully packed so that it’s also a very good choice as a gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IDKqq7z+L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"olelo","source_asin":"B08FGZBJRB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-692189","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FGZBJRB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FGZBJRB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
