window.products.push({"id":692283,"name":"GAC Rectangular Tempered Glass Salad/Dessert Plate Set With Charcoal Black Trim, Service for 8, Break and Chip Resistant – Microwave and Oven Safe – D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zaxInIgVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tempered Glass Salad / Dessert Plate Set with Black Trim, Service for 8 FEATURES and BENFITS: Break and chip resistant The charcoal black glass dessert plate is made of tough glass for extra durability. Will not break when falls to the ground. Great advantage especially with little ones around. Dishwasher safe This black salad plate allows carefree hosting and entertaining. No burden and hassle when serving, it requires no handwashing. Perfect dinnerware set for daily use. Stack ability Keeps your cupboards organized as these glass serving plates stack well and take up little shelf space. This is the perfect solution to your small kitchen space problem. Oven and microwave safe Up to 350 degrees Fahrenheit. It’s easy to prepare the food in advance and warm them up when you need them with this feature. Take these rectangular black dessert plates straight from the oven to table, this leaves you with less dirty pots and pans to wash. Elegant design With striped glass bottom, this black trim plate has a charcoal rim at the outer edge and a frosted stripe around the outer center of the plate. The glass rectangular plate makes a true statement with its elegant yet modern design. Easily complete this set We feature matching large size rimmed black glass plates that match perfectly to these. They work well for dinner plates, serving plates, centerpiece platters… Set also comes with matching trays and platters is 3 different sizes. GAC products are built to last! We only manufacture the highest quality materials with beautiful luxury living designs and styles. Enjoy!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81zaxInIgVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GAC Great American Classics","source_asin":"B01CIK0J64","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-692283","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CIK0J64","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CIK0J64","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":692284,"name":"Pizzelle Maker - Non-stick Electric Pizzelle Baker Press Makes Two 5-Inch Cookies at Once- Recipe Guide Included- Summer Party Dessert Treat Making Ma","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815wJEuvFgS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pizzelle Maker- Non-stick Pizzelle Baker Press Makes 5 Inch Cookies- Pizzelle (pronounced with ts sound, like \"pizza\") (singular pizzella) are traditional Italian waffle cookies made from flour, eggs, sugar, butter or vegetable oil, and flavoring (often vanilla, anise, or lemon zest). Pizzelle can be hard and crisp or soft and chewy depending on the ingredients and method of preparation. Pizzelle were originally made in Ortona, in the Abruzzo region of south-central Italy. The name comes from the Italian word for \"round\" and \"flat\" (pizze); this is also the meaning of the word pizza. Many other cultures have developed a pizzelle-type cookie as part of their culture (for example, the Norwegian Krumkake). It is known to be one of the oldest cookie. Pizzelle are known as ferratelle in the Lazio region of Italy. In Molise they may be called ferratelle, cancelle, or pizzelle. The cookie dough or batter is put into a pizzelle iron. The iron stamps a snowflake pattern onto both sides of the thin golden-brown cookie, which has a crisp texture once it is cooled. Pizzelle shaped into a cannolo and filled with an orange-almond crème. Pizzelle are popular during Christmas and Easter. They are often found at Italian weddings, alongside other traditional pastries such as cannoli and traditional Italian cookies. It is also common for two pizzelle to be sandwiched with cannoli cream (ricotta blended with sugar) or hazelnut spread. Pizzelle, while still warm, can also be rolled using a wooden dowel to create cannoli shells.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815wJEuvFgS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CucinaPro","source_asin":"B00CV4PQFW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-692284","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00CV4PQFW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00CV4PQFW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
