window.products.push({"id":692339,"name":"Z ZTDM Air Fryer Oven with Rotisserie, 17 QT 8-in-1 Air Fryer Dehydrator Toaster Oven with Trays, 1800W Airfryer 8 Cooking Presets & 9 Accessories, Di","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719pBCvUXsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"8 IN 1 AIR FRYER OVEN: The air fryer built-in 8 one-touch preset functions meet all of your daily cooking needs. It has 3 dehydration racks and can cook multiple batches at a time. The air fryer has ETL certification and combines the functions of air fryer + oven + rotisserie +dehydrator. The multi-function air fryer oven will create a variety of cuisines to meet your diversified cooking needs. SAFE & EASY TO OPERATE: The air fryer has ETL certification.It with automatic shut off function and overheat protection to prevent over-cooking and ensure safety. The convenient LED digital touch screen allows you to easily select the cooking mode with one touch.With a cool touch handle and butt on protection cover to prevent accidental disassembly and further ensure safety. LARGE CAPACITY & VISIBLE WINDOW: The compact appearance and the 17QT large-capacity design allow you to prepare ample gourme food for your family without taking up too much space. The interior is made of galvanized steel to avoid the smell of plastic. With buttom non-slip feet and heat-resistant shell to ensure safety. With glass doors and interior lighting, you can monitor your cooking progress at any time. COMPLETE COOKING ACCESSORIES: Each air fryer is equipped with 9 useful cooking accessories, including a drip tray, reclaimer, chicken spit, 3 dehydration racks, skewers, grill and manual.It contain everything you need, so you can easily enjoy a good meal.All accessories are detachable for easy cleaning. OIL-FREE HEALTHY FOOD: Compared with the traditional hot oil cooking method, the air fryer adopts a new technology of 360° hot air circulation to cook food. It can reduce fat by up to 80%.The cooking speed is fast and without splashing oil vapor on the kitchen countertop. So you can easily provide you with healthy food and delicious dishes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719pBCvUXsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Z ZTDM","source_asin":"B082PN28YL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-692339","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082PN28YL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082PN28YL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":692340,"name":"Willow Tree Love My Cat (Light), Sculpted Hand-Painted Figure","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xY7RlY85L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"TITLE: Love my Cat (light) SENTIMENT: Always with me, full of personality! GIFT-GIVING SUGGESTIONS: Pets join the Willow Tree family! Dog and Cat figures work well with other family pieces to create Family Groupings. Hand-carved figures reveal their expression through body gestures only… a tilt of the head, a turn of the body. Willow Tree is a reminder of someone we want to keep close, or a memory we want to touch. Since 1999, American artist Susan Lordi has worked in partnership with DEMDACO to produce, market and distribute Willow Tree, her line of carved figurative sculpture. From her studio in Kansas City, Lordi hand carves the original of each figure. This piece is cast from Lordi's original and painted by hand. Enclosed inside each fitted packaging box is a gift-giving card with piece title and sentiment on it. Each piece is intended to be open to interpretation from the viewer. \"Willow Tree isn't so much about the tangible piece. It represents an emotion or it marks a memory.\" -Susan Lordi","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xY7RlY85L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Willow Tree","source_asin":"B07CTK4W3V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-692340","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CTK4W3V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CTK4W3V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
