window.products.push({"id":692354,"name":"Low Profile Hook-On Rail System - Queen Size","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41sLvcHFJRL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Purpose of the Low-Profile Bedframe The Low Profile Bedframe is designed to sit much lower to the floor than the traditional bedframe. This lowered height is achieved not only with shorter legs, but through the design of the bedframe itself. The result is a bedframe designed from the floor up to sit lower to the floor without any sacrifice in comfort, security, or quality of construction. Situations in Which the Low Profile Bedframe Can Be of Benefit There is a fear/risk of falling: Because the Low Profile Bed is closer to the floor, the fear of falling is minimized. If a fall does occur, injuries are eliminated or minimized because the bed is much closer to the floor.  Ease of Use: Persons with mobility issues can benefit from a bed that is easier to get into and out of. Climbing and lifting needs are eliminated or minimized.  Super Thick Mattresses: Can sometimes cause a bed's total height to increase to uncomfortably high levels. The Low Profile Bedframe could help bring the bed back down to a comfortable height.  Decorative Concerns: Sometimes it is desirable to decrease a bed's presence in a room. Lowering the height of the bed is one way to accomplish this. This Low Profile Rail System This Low Profile Hook-On Rail System can lower your bed by 3 1/4\". The floor to boxspring distance will be approximately 4 1/16\" - 5 1/16\".  This Low Profile Hook-On Rail system is designed to be used with your hook-on headboard and footboard. Your present headboard and footboard will continue to help provide support. Included Center Support System Center Support System includes two cross rails running from head to foot, each with one adjustable glide equipped leg. Made in the U.S.A. Made with pride in the United States under strict quality control guidelines.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41sLvcHFJRL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hospitality Bed","source_asin":"B004O9IJGA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-692354","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004O9IJGA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004O9IJGA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
