window.products.push({"id":692494,"name":"Silicone Cake Mold for Baking，8 Holes 3D Stone Round Shape Silicone Mousse Cake Pop Form,Non-Stick Candy Chocolate Jelly Baking Mould Tray,Pastry Chee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWAA55k6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description： 100% Brand new and high quality. Name:Silicone Cake Mold. Material:Silicone. Color:White. Size:29.7 *17.5*2.8 cm. Product weight:180 g. Shape:Stone Round Shape Package included:1 x Cake Mold. Uses:Cherry mousse dessert baking,chocolate,cake making. Use and maintenance: 1. After each use, use hot water (diluted food cleaner) or put it in a dishwasher to clean it. Do not use abrasive cleaning or foam cleaning. Make sure that the silicone cup is dry before each use and storage. 2.Baking the silicone cup should be placed separately on the baking tray. Do not dry the mold, for example, for a 8-die, if you only need to use four moulds, the other three models must also be installed on the water. Otherwise it will cause the mold to be baked bad, resulting in lower service life. In order to ensure that the finished product to achieve the best baking effect, in the baking before the first layer of silica gel cup can be gently spray a small amount of anti-stick pan oil. 3. When baking is finished, remove the entire baking tray from the oven and place the roasted product on the cooler to be cooled until it is completely cooled! 4.Silicone cups can only be used in ovens, ovens, microwave ovens, and are strictly prohibited for direct use of gas, fire or power, and directly above the heating plate or barbecue underneath! 5. Do not use a knife or other weapon for silicone products and avoid stress, pull!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWAA55k6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"W WBLD","source_asin":"B085QFQFTS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-692494","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085QFQFTS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085QFQFTS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":692495,"name":"iDesign Striped Fabric Bathroom Shower Curtain, 72 x 72","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yESSB-LoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Add some fun to your bathroom with the iDesign Striped Shower Curtain! This fast-drying, 100% polyester shower curtain is high-quality, allowing you to use it for years to come. The rainbow stripes add a touch of whimsy while the white background makes it easy to match with other pieces in your bathroom. When it is time to freshen up, simply toss the shower curtain into the washing machine for a quick and easy clean that is wrinkle-free. Designed with reinforced button holes, this curtain can be used with S hooks, ring hooks, and other shower curtain hooks. Measuring 72\" x 72\", the iDesign Striped Shower Curtain fits typical bathtubs and showers on straight or curved curtain rods. With iDesign by InterDesign, you can #livesimply every day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51yESSB-LoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iDesign","source_asin":"B07H842V3B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-692495","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H842V3B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H842V3B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
