window.products.push({"id":692500,"name":"Bright Zeal 5.5\" Tall Large Xmas Christmas Marquee Sign Letters (Bronze, 6hr Timer) - Christmas Signs For Wreaths Sign Marquee Christmas Signs Decor -","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWjpqsY5L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"LARGE LED Marquee \"XMAS\" Lights Up Christmas Spirit 1. This 5.5\" tall large marquee sign letter set spells out Xmas with 22 LED bulbs evenly spaced within it, making a bold statement for your coming Christmas during the day time.2. At night, LED bulbs shine gently through the bronze finish, giving your home warm white glow & providing a warm Christmas feeling.3. A perfect festive display for your mantel, picture window, table, wall or the church to light up Christmas spirit. CHRISTMASE DECOR CENTERPIECE OR WALL DECOR 1. When you prefer a Christmas display on your table, this Christmas marquee sign will be a warmth emitting centerpiece to create your own elaborate holiday scene.2. Two keyhole slots in back for easy display on the wall.3. Versatile uses for any living room, office, study or bedroom. SIX-HOUR TIMER FOR YOUR CONVENIENCE 1. An OFF/ON switch at back of the marquee sign for manual control.2. Once the marquee sign is switched on, the 6hr timer will be triggered.3. LED bulbs will stay illuminated for 6 hours & then remain off for 18 hours, only to light up again for another 6 hours automatically. EASY DECORATING & ENERGY-SAVING & DURABLE 1. No power outlet needed & requires 2 AA batteries (included) for easy decorating.2. Long lasting LED bulbs provide low energy consumption & produce no heat after long-time use.3. Made of durable polystyrene material. FAQs 1. The product can be hung (with 2 keyhole slots in back for easy hanging) on walls, or stand alone on your table.2. ON/OFF switch is on the back. Attention 1. Six-Hour Timer - The product can be left on for 6 hours and then remains off for 18 hours, only to light up again for another 6 hours automatically.2. INDOOR USE RECOMMENDED - If using outdoors, please place it under a covered area.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWjpqsY5L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bright Zeal","source_asin":"B074C6X464","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-692500","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074C6X464","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074C6X464","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
