window.products.push({"id":692525,"name":"Pink Guppy, 100% Cotton, Plaid Boy's Quilt/ Coverlet & Quilted Plaid Euro Sham, Twin Bed Size, Blue & Moss Green, Farm Vegetables & Fruit Graphics on ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tAIgbJoRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pink Guppy Kids is focused on high quality sustainable products with exciting designs. The quilt and Euro sham are part of a Farmhouse theme, kids bedding set. They are 100% cotton with 200 thread count weave making the fabric dense. This makes it soft and smooth to touch. The cotton fibres makes it light, airy and breathable Cotton is a lightweight fluffy fibre that traps air to keep a person insulated and warm naturally. They are printed with azo free dyes and are safe for kids. The Quilt looks great on a twin bed as a coverlet or a bedspread and can be used as a light comforter during hot summers. It’s perfect as a twin sized quilt. It is 100% Cotton both the material and filling. The quilt has stylised graphics of farm fruits and vegetables such as onions, bananas, lemons, cherries, strawberry, chillies on squares print with earth and primary colors. The Cute plaid quilted eurosham with brown frill goes perfectly with the quilt and is perfect for leaning and reading in bed. Supports the whole back and matches the Quilt. The hand quilting gives it an interesting crinkly effect. Strong Earth tones for the child’s room. Rustic and chic decor. This cotton quilt and sham set look lovely as earthy farm theme decor or farmhouse bedding home décor. Works well with the matching comforter set. Can be a part of a toddler set on a twin bed for boys or toddler bedding sets for girls as well. With a twin comforter set this coupled with a throw pillow brightens up the room with these earth farm colours. Make a great looking kids bed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tAIgbJoRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pink Guppy","source_asin":"B00OBH536E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-692525","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OBH536E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OBH536E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
