window.products.push({"id":692558,"name":"8PC Tutsin Full Size Bed in a Bag- Medium Weight Down Alternative Comforter (Duvet Insert) with Cotton Duvet Cover Set and Bed Sheets","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":143.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qZP1HOlkL._AC_SL1138_.jpg","description":"A Lovely 8 PIECE BED IN A BAG just through ONE CLICK and at a REASONABLE PRICE! Enjoy a RESTFUL NIGHT'S SLEEP under the Perfect Warmth of our Soft All Season Medium Fill Weight Microfiber Down Alternative Duvet Insert (Comforter) with the Outstanding Box Stitch construction design that keeps fill evenly distributed. In addition to this SOFT Down Alternative Comforter, you’re also receiving 100-Percent Cotton SOFT Printed Duvet Cover with Matching Pillow Shams, creating an BOLD LOOK to YOUR BED/ GUEST BEDROOM or Any Other Bedding Set You Have in Your Home/ Vacation Home/ Cabin/ Cottage...etc. The Duvet Cover Sets come in the Combination of Colors to Bring Life to Your Room! To Complete Your Bed Set, We added 4PC Bed Sheets Set That Includes a Flat and Fitted Sheets with 2 Pillow Cases. You will ENJOY WRAPPING YOURSELF IN THE SOFTNESS and COMFORT of Our Linens! \"The Down Alternative Comforter is packed tightly during shipping. Upon receipt, remove it from their packaging, fluff gently and allow several hours to recover their full loft. In addition, being sealed in plastic packaging sometimes causes the scent of these natural products to concentrate to a disagreeable level. A few hours of airing the comforter usually removes the odor\" *HOW TO ASSEMBLE YOUR BEDDING SET: You Simply Insert the White Down Comforter into the Duvet/Comforter Cover with Button Enclosures at the bottom, this will protect your comforter and keep it easy maintenance and Put Your Sheets on the Bed. Now you are ready to enjoy a Good Night's Sleep! * We offer our Bed in a Bag in 4 different sizes: Full, Queen, King and California King- which is PERFECT for YOU and YOUR FAMILY or even as a GIFT to a Loved One* ORDER NOW and BEGIN YOUR SWEET DREAMS!! NOTE: Due to different screen displays, the color of the actual item may vary slightly from the above images. But No Worries! Our Customer Satisfaction is 100% Guaranteed!!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qZP1HOlkL._AC_SL1138_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"sheetsnthings","source_asin":"B09KRSBSMN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-692558","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KRSBSMN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KRSBSMN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
