window.products.push({"id":692602,"name":"Novolix Tomato Shape 60 Minutes Timer Kitchen Gadget Mechanical Rotating Alarm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZFfEEsgTL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"About Our Store Innovation, good quality and service are our goals, we are doing our best to serve customers of Amazon. Our products are designed based on the fashionable trend and produced with great care, only to promise quality. Any questions, do not hesitate to contact us, we are here to help. Features Mechanical Drive:It is a practical and economical spring wound alarm without battery.Automatic Ring:The bell will automatically ring when it rotates to setting time. Parameters Operating Temperature:-10℃～+55℃.Operating Angle:360 degree.Operating Direction:Clockwise Rotation.Timing Range:0-60 minutes.Ringing Time:Based on the timing range,timing range is long,ringing time will be long. Normal Operations 1.At first, Rotate clockwise to the end (60minute point).2.Anticlockwise Rotate to time point you want to set up.If you want to set fixed time to 25 minutes,just rotate in counterclockwise direction to the 25 minutes point.3.When time's up,it rings automatically. Maintenance Note:Please don’t rotate the timer vigorously and repeatedly,in case that the built-in movement parts are destroyed. Package Including 1x Tomato Timer.One Wool Felt Coaster is sent with the package.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZFfEEsgTL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Novolix","source_asin":"B01HM9B5ZA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-692602","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HM9B5ZA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HM9B5ZA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
