window.products.push({"id":692710,"name":"Saffron Marigold Indian Summer ~ Orange Paisley Exotic Sari Print Twin Bedspread 70x90","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":100.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ADc-zIzLL._AC_.jpg","description":"Tropical mango and juicy red papaya tones play across this oh-so-summery cotton bedspread. You'll find that you want to rent a beach house just so that you can showcase this hand printed jungle beauty! Use natural fiber accents and hang art that reminds you of Paul Gaugin to complete your Indian Summer bedroom! The Twin bedspread is 70 inches wide and 90 inches long and is printed on preshrunk, superior grade, soft cotton and is exquisitely finished with neat double stitched hemsEach piece is handcrafted using intricately hand carved wooden blocks and is an original work of art distinguished by the work of the artisan, the particular lot of dye, and even varying weather conditions. Tonal variations are inherent to the block printing process and enhance the individuality, character and uniqueness of each creation. About Indian Summer: Under the sweltering sun, the heart of the Indian summer unfolds many a sensory extravagance. The ambrosial sweetness of sun ripened mangoes, the heady fragrance of velvety roses, and the quiet rustle of opulent silk saris. Indian Summers saffron hued ground provides a brilliant backdrop to the delicate ornamentation of the unusual three leaf, rose kissed petite paisley print replete with emerald green highlights. Indian Summer conjures up an abstract edible quality of rose petals atop a lush mango sorbet.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ADc-zIzLL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Saffron Marigold","source_asin":"B07BVMY5P1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-692710","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BVMY5P1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BVMY5P1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
