window.products.push({"id":692757,"name":"Shower Caddy,Bathroom Organizer,Shower Organizer (2 Pack),Adhesive Shower Organizer No Drilling,Self Adhesive Bathroom Shelves Basket,Corner Shower Sh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716LZ7fZ94L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Specifications: -- Material: Metal -- Color: Black -- Size: 13.4\" L*6.1\" W* 2.8\" H --Package: 2 Pack of bathroom organizer Large capacity can storage more item at bathroom. How to use? 1. Clean the surface where you want to install the shelf. 2. Mark the adhesive shape clearly where placed with EACH shelf attached. 3.Remove the protective film of the adhesive, and then stick it to the cleaned wall. 4. Wait 24 hours. 4. Attach the basket on the adhesive hook. Removal Guide If you would like to remove the adhesive, please use a hairdryer to heat it, then it will be easy to tear off.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716LZ7fZ94L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bofflusa","source_asin":"B0BTXBRWDB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-692757","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTXBRWDB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTXBRWDB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":692758,"name":"Wellbeing Brown Throw Blanket, Reversible Faux Fur Blanket for Couch,Soft Fuzzy Throws for Bed,Sofa,Chair(50\" x 60\" )","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lza-wc9rS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"100 % Polyester-faux Fur Material Features: 100% polyester blanket, luxuriously soft and cozy. Double layer Design: This 2 layer throw is thicker than the normal single layer throw, and offers a total luxurious experience with an ultra soft touch. The 270gsm solid rabbit faux fur with ribbed channel pattern reverses to a 200gsm solid faux mink for a super soft throw blanket. Usage Scenes: Durable and warm double-layer throw, perfect for snuggling with while watching TV on the couch, or relaxing on your sofa and bed.Enjoy your family time with cozy and soft throw blanket while relaxing on the couch or in the garden. The double-layer throw is very lightweight and easy to carry, prefect for office napping and outdoor camping to provide continuous warmth throughout the year. Easy Care: Machine wash with cold water in gentle cycles, tumble drying at low temperature. It can be washed and dried many times. Decorative: The extraordinary plush fur face comes in a variety of lusciously rich colors, accented by an understated channel design. The reverse features a soft and smooth micro mink creating an elegant finish.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lza-wc9rS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WELLBEING BY SUNHAM","source_asin":"B08JGY2J67","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-692758","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JGY2J67","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JGY2J67","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":692759,"name":"Homebrewers Outpost KEG421 Torpedo Keg - 1.5 Gal Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.16,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/213KM0uHqAL._AC_.jpg","description":"Set your sights on a brand new Torpedo Keg! The sleek all-stainless design represents a new era of homebrew kegs. With features like welded stainless handles, the ability to stack with fittings in place, amazing quality and a great price we think these kegs will become the standard by which other kegs are measured. Quality First The first thing we at More Beer! check out is interior welds. We've spent a decade rejecting kegs made overseas because the interior welds have never met our standards. If a weld is not perfect and shows evident burn marks along with nooks and crannies it cannot be sanitized effectively. Torpedo kegs are machine welded and exceed our standards for quality. The weld quality is possible because these kegs made by an ISO certified commercial keg manufacturer. Cool Features Torpedo Kegs were designed to stack with Ball Lock quick disconnects in place and serving which is a cool feature for some brewers who have vertical space in their refrigerator. We also like the rolled stainless steel handles. They are comfortable to grab and will never come off like some rubber handles can over time. In and Out is etched near the keg posts for easy identification which is very handy when you are connecting lines in a refrigerator or kegerator and trying not to make a mistake. Overall for the price and quality, along with free shipping from More Beer!, the Torpedo Keg is an amazing value! Dimensions: Height (in.) Diameter (in.) 1.5 Gal 10 9.125 2.5 Gal 14.5 9.125 5 Gal 22.75 9.125 Please Note: These are about 1/2\" wider than standard Ball Lock Cornelius Kegs. Need something a bit slimmer? Check out the new lineup of Slim line Torpedo Kegs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/213KM0uHqAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homebrewers Outpost","source_asin":"B072JJ3S1V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-692759","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072JJ3S1V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072JJ3S1V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":692760,"name":"Beatrix Potter Peter Rabbit Mug, One Size","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417j5DBIJ6L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Drink your cup of tea or coffee in style with this beautiful Peter rabbit mug. Border fine arts has been producing the world of Beatrix Potter products since being granted a licence in 1987, since then the collection has grown to include many different formats. Each mug is presented in our new style branded gift box. Material; ceramic. Dishwasher and microwave safe. Not a toy or children's product. Intended for adults only. Mug measures 9.5cm. Set Contains: 1 x Peter Rabbit Mug","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417j5DBIJ6L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beatrix Potter","source_asin":"B07DT79QQS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-692760","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DT79QQS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DT79QQS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":692761,"name":"Artisan Owl Dad Est. 2022 - Daddy Father Papa Pops First Time New Parent - 15oz Deluxe Double-Sided Coffee Tea Mug","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Jp1CRi+7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GREAT GIFT OR SPOIL YOURSELF - You're going to be a DAD! Our DAD est. 2022 mug is the perfect conversation starter. DESIGNED WITH YOU IN MIND - We know that your time is valuable. Unlike most mugs which hold 11 ounces, we have printed our design on a mug which holds a generous 15 ounces of liquid, allowing you to pour and enjoy more. This extra-large high-fired ceramic mug, with easy-grip handle, will keep your morning dose of caffeine piping hot as you start your day. QUALITY MATTERS TO US - Our mugs are printed using high-definition graphics, detailed color contrast, and completed with a high gloss finish. Our double-sided printed design allow both right-handed and left-handed caffeine drinkers to show off this vibrant mug to family, friends, and coworkers. Additionally, our mugs are dishwasher and microwave safe, which allows you to enjoy them over and over again. PERFECT FOR MANY OCCASIONS - Our DAD est. 2022 mug is a great daily functional accent piece for any new parent navigating their caffeine intake between home, work, and everywhere else. YOUR SATISFACTION MATTERS - We are so confident in our mugs, we guarantee a One Year Limited Warranty. If the mug you ordered shows any signs of imperfection, fades, or cracks within a year of purchase, we will send you a replacement or provide a full refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Jp1CRi+7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Artisan Owl","source_asin":"B08XN21PD1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-692761","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XN21PD1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XN21PD1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
