window.products.push({"id":692880,"name":"Bubba Envy 24-Ounce Travel Mug - Includes Large Silicone Straw - Realtree","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mcXomnzsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Trust bubba to keep your drinks cold with this bubba Envy Insulated Double Wall Tumbler. Made of BPA-free Eastman Tritan plastic, the bubba cup with straw and lid is impact-resistant, stain-resistant, and odor-resistant. That way, if you prefer a cold drink of water in the afternoon and a raspberry mojito during happy hour, you won't have any lingering stains or odors once your bubba mug is rinsed out. The plastic water bottle features double-wall construction which reduces condensation on the outside of your insulated mug so you can easily hold it and keep your drink cold for hours. Sip from the spill-proof, easy-clean lid with or without a straw. You'll only need one hand to drink, leaving the other free for applying sunscreen or flipping pages of a magazine. To clean, simply rinse these bubba mugs with warm water and mild soap or place in the dishwasher for hands free cleaning. Makes a great gift for any occasion or person in your life: birthday, anniversary, holiday, men, women, etc. This bubba tumbler with handle is the ultimate vacation companion or summer sidekick for frosty cold beverages that'll make you think of swaying palm trees and perfect beaches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mcXomnzsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BUBBA BRANDS","source_asin":"B00XMH85HI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-692880","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00XMH85HI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00XMH85HI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":692881,"name":"Piece 100% Soft Flannel Cotton Bed Sheet Set – Queen/King Size – Patterned Bedding Covers – 1 Flat Sheet, 1 Fitted Sheet, 2 Pillow Cases - Fade Resist","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WIBq46kuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Falling into Bed After A Long Tiring Day Is So Much Better In A Bed That Is Covered With Luxury, Soft Warm And Comfy Flannel Sheets. 🛌 Soft and Warm for a Good Night’s Sleep! We all need a sanctuary where we can just burrow away under our covers away from any stressful things around us.Curling up under these extra soft brushed flannel sheets will make you feel a whole lot better,especially if you take a cup of hot cocoa into bed with you.Get that undisturbed tranquil sleep that you deserve when you are wrapped up in your brand-new flannel bedding.Just be warned if you have kids they may be snuggling down under the covers with you unless you get them their own set. ❄ Features & Specifications of our Patterned Sheet Set: ✔ 100% real cotton flannel fabric.✔ 6 Unique Patterns: Elk, Moon and Stars, Plaid, Stripes, Toile, Floral.✔ 4 Piece Bed Sheet Set: 1 Flat Sheet, 1 Fitted Sheet, 2 Pillow Cases.✔ Made of strong, fade-resistant fabric to stay fresh and vibrant for years to come.✔ Fully elasticized border for a snug fit that won’t bunch or come loose.✔ 12” Deep Fully Elasticated Pocket.✔ Will Not Wrinkle Easily.✔ Heavy Weight Flannel 170 GSM. Easy To Clean! Machine wash cold. Do not bleach. Tumble dry low. remove promptly from dryer to avoid wrinkles PRODUCT DIMENSIONS: 👑 Queen Size: ↔ 1 Fitted sheet: 60 inches wide x 80 inches long with a 12-inch pocket↔ 1 Flat sheet: 90 inches wide x 102 inches long↔ 2 Standard pillowcases: 20 inches wide x 30 inches long👑 King Size: ↔ 1 Fitted sheet: 78 inches wide x 80 inches long with a 12-inch pocket↔ 1 Flat sheet: 110 inches wide x 102 inches long↔ 2 King pillowcases: 20 inches wide x 40 inches long Crafted entirely of 100% cotton flannel these durable, high quality sheet sets will add that extra warmth and cozy feel to your bedroom this winter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WIBq46kuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AM Home Fashion","source_asin":"B0BH7WYCY2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-692881","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BH7WYCY2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BH7WYCY2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
