window.products.push({"id":692971,"name":"Soup Spoon, Silicone Spoon, Gravy Ladle, Floating Soup Ladles for Serving - Swan Ladles For Cooking","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Aly4gh8gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Meet Sleek & Elegant Swanky - From the design awarded OTOTO studio comes Swanky, the graceful kitchen ladle. Scoop from the depths of the pot and serve into your bowls with these elegant BPA-free cooking spoons! Lightweight & Easy to Hold - Perfect for all kinds of scooping, Swanky is always ready to serve. You can scoop up soups, gravies, and more with our luxe silicone ladle for cooking. Fancies Up Any Occasion - Serve to impress with Swanky, the elegant big spoon by your side. These swan-tastic soup ladles for cooking can take the heat with their heat-resistant and dishwasher safe materials. Swanky Little Treat - Looking for new kitchen gifts for your loved ones, or cute kitchen gadgets to add to your collection? Swanky the silicone spoon adds class to every kitchen it graces. A sprinkle of fun - Ever heard of the one where they lived happily ever after? Well, that's always the story with OTOTO's products. We strive to create home products with a quirky twist. Our cute products are here to stop the bore in doing chores!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Aly4gh8gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OTOTO","source_asin":"B0BS9F3YSL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-692971","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS9F3YSL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS9F3YSL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":692972,"name":"Microplane Chili Mill - Perfect for Grinding Chili Peppers into Flakes and Seasoning Food","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mueLYb5hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With the Microplane Chili mill you can quickly and easily grate a variety of dried chilies in no time and without much effort. The signature, razor-sharp, photo-etched Microplane stainless steel blades -Made in USA – grate the chilies evenly and precisely so the essential oils can develop optimally and taste is enhanced!With a luxurious silk feel grip for comfort and stability, the new Chili Mill is incredibly easy to use. Hold on to the stainless steel ring and turn to open. Place the dried chilies in the cavity and click the top back into place. The Precise Pressure™ Engineered Tension Spring applies optimum pressure to the dried chilies for perfect grating. By gently turning the handle/top clockwise, you get finely grated chilies flakes and depending on the dosage, you can get a delicate aroma or add more heat and wonderful depth of flavor to q wide range of sweet and savory dishes. There is a handy silicone cap included that prevents fine spice dust from spreading to the table and worktop after the Mill was in use. This is especially useful when the chili mill is put on the table for seasoning the food.To clean, disassemble the chili mill and rinse under running water and allow to dry. Dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mueLYb5hL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Microplane","source_asin":"B08H2GWQJC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-692972","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H2GWQJC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H2GWQJC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
